1
00:01:32,680 --> 00:01:35,020
[Forging Justice]

2
00:01:35,180 --> 00:01:37,650
[Episode 4]

3
00:01:39,680 --> 00:01:40,280
Comrades,

4
00:01:41,350 --> 00:01:43,229
are you court officers?

5
00:01:43,950 --> 00:01:44,310
Yes.

6
00:01:44,680 --> 00:01:46,479
We're all officers of the county court.

7
00:01:46,479 --> 00:01:47,740
My name is Xia Yingjie.

8
00:01:48,400 --> 00:01:49,729
Are you a villager here?

9
00:01:51,870 --> 00:01:52,800
You could say so,

10
00:01:53,430 --> 00:01:54,630
but I'm actually not.

11
00:01:55,479 --> 00:01:57,710
Qiu Agui and I are from the same village.
We came here

12
00:01:57,710 --> 00:01:59,640
through marriage at the same time.

13
00:02:02,310 --> 00:02:03,370
Just like her, I was

14
00:02:03,790 --> 00:02:05,520
beaten by my husband every day.

15
00:02:07,270 --> 00:02:09,070
My husband was named Feng Dazhi.

16
00:02:15,400 --> 00:02:16,930
Mrs. Feng, are you alright?

17
00:02:18,150 --> 00:02:20,010
You know your man gambled, right?

18
00:02:20,870 --> 00:02:22,070
Though he's dead now,

19
00:02:23,000 --> 00:02:25,000
the debts he owed
must be paid off on time.

20
00:02:25,000 --> 00:02:26,190
I'll give you one month.

21
00:02:26,190 --> 00:02:27,190
No delay allowed.

22
00:02:38,240 --> 00:02:39,079
Bastard,

23
00:02:39,880 --> 00:02:41,340
why didn't you die sooner?

24
00:02:47,579 --> 00:02:48,490
Slow down!

25
00:02:48,520 --> 00:02:49,430
Even if you could

26
00:02:49,430 --> 00:02:50,079
make it back now,

27
00:02:50,079 --> 00:02:51,940
Mentor will have gotten off work.

28
00:02:56,150 --> 00:02:57,840
Slow down! This is a downhill.

29
00:02:59,430 --> 00:03:00,520
Go slower, slower.

30
00:03:01,890 --> 00:03:04,590
[Nanyu County People's Court,
People's Procuratorate]

31
00:03:03,290 --> 00:03:04,620
The lights are still on.

32
00:03:05,080 --> 00:03:06,080
The lights are on.

33
00:03:06,080 --> 00:03:06,410
What?

34
00:03:07,200 --> 00:03:07,910
Careful.

35
00:03:07,910 --> 00:03:08,710
Quick, Lihui!

36
00:03:17,710 --> 00:03:18,190
Mentor!

37
00:03:18,960 --> 00:03:19,560
Mentor...

38
00:03:19,960 --> 00:03:20,820
What happened?

39
00:03:20,960 --> 00:03:22,490
Where have you been all day?

40
00:03:23,030 --> 00:03:23,690
Qiu Agui...

41
00:03:23,880 --> 00:03:24,710
What's with Qiu Agui?

42
00:03:24,710 --> 00:03:25,370
Qiu Agui...

43
00:03:28,560 --> 00:03:29,620
This is killing me.

44
00:03:30,079 --> 00:03:30,870
I'd rather not go in.

45
00:03:30,870 --> 00:03:31,930
I'm... exhausted.

46
00:03:32,560 --> 00:03:33,590
How could they not even

47
00:03:33,590 --> 00:03:34,240
thank us?

48
00:03:35,400 --> 00:03:37,130
They just worked us to the bone.

49
00:03:37,280 --> 00:03:38,540
I can understand them.

50
00:03:39,720 --> 00:03:41,120
What was said by that woman we met later

51
00:03:41,120 --> 00:03:42,250
is quite important.

52
00:03:42,560 --> 00:03:43,490
Perhaps that can

53
00:03:43,800 --> 00:03:45,400
really save Qiu Agui's life.

54
00:03:45,560 --> 00:03:47,290
Of course you understand them,

55
00:03:47,590 --> 00:03:49,050
since you're all the same,

56
00:03:49,360 --> 00:03:51,360
with the same kind of stubbornness.

57
00:03:51,870 --> 00:03:52,670
Are you saying

58
00:03:53,520 --> 00:03:55,320
that I'm the same as Xia Yingjie?

59
00:03:55,680 --> 00:03:56,610
I mean all of you.

60
00:04:03,800 --> 00:04:04,330
Qiu Agui,

61
00:04:04,680 --> 00:04:06,000
we're officers of the county court.

62
00:04:06,000 --> 00:04:07,520
Today, you'll be interrogated.

63
00:04:07,520 --> 00:04:08,400
You must be provide

64
00:04:08,400 --> 00:04:09,410
candid answers,

65
00:04:09,800 --> 00:04:11,240
without hiding anything.

66
00:04:11,240 --> 00:04:12,640
Have I made myself clear?

67
00:04:13,840 --> 00:04:14,520
Yes.

68
00:04:16,630 --> 00:04:18,290
Why did you kill your husband?

69
00:04:23,160 --> 00:04:25,070
I couldn't take the beatings anymore.

70
00:04:25,070 --> 00:04:26,530
Was there no other reason?

71
00:04:30,920 --> 00:04:31,430
No.

72
00:04:37,360 --> 00:04:38,070
Officers,

73
00:04:38,630 --> 00:04:40,159
I killed a man. I should die.

74
00:04:40,270 --> 00:04:41,800
Please sentence me to death.

75
00:04:41,800 --> 00:04:42,870
I just hope the government will

76
00:04:42,870 --> 00:04:43,430
take good care

77
00:04:43,430 --> 00:04:44,890
of my three poor children.

78
00:04:45,600 --> 00:04:46,270
Qiu Agui,

79
00:04:47,390 --> 00:04:48,650
you committed a crime.

80
00:04:49,440 --> 00:04:50,930
The punishment on you

81
00:04:51,000 --> 00:04:52,460
will be decided by the law.

82
00:04:53,159 --> 00:04:54,760
That said, you must honestly

83
00:04:55,480 --> 00:04:56,830
tell us all that happened

84
00:04:56,830 --> 00:04:58,090
and withhold nothing.

85
00:04:58,360 --> 00:04:59,490
Let me ask you again.

86
00:05:01,040 --> 00:05:02,160
Did you kill Huang Liancang

87
00:05:02,160 --> 00:05:03,560
only because he beat you?

88
00:05:03,720 --> 00:05:05,180
Was there no other reason?

89
00:05:12,430 --> 00:05:12,830
Right.

90
00:05:14,510 --> 00:05:16,710
I couldn't stand the beatings anymore.

91
00:05:17,120 --> 00:05:18,480
Qiu Agui, spill the truth.

92
00:05:18,480 --> 00:05:19,560
Don't hide it anymore.

93
00:05:19,560 --> 00:05:19,880
Xia.

94
00:05:19,910 --> 00:05:21,370
-We already know...
-Xia.

95
00:05:28,270 --> 00:05:29,240
To protect your children,

96
00:05:29,240 --> 00:05:31,100
you must protect yourself first.

97
00:05:31,950 --> 00:05:33,190
If anything is to your advantage,

98
00:05:33,190 --> 00:05:34,310
make sure you say it honestly.

99
00:05:34,310 --> 00:05:35,120
Only in this way can we

100
00:05:35,120 --> 00:05:37,120
help you find a way to save your skin.

101
00:05:42,750 --> 00:05:43,360
Animals.

102
00:05:43,860 --> 00:05:45,120
Both men were animals.

103
00:05:48,000 --> 00:05:48,560
But...

104
00:05:49,510 --> 00:05:50,770
is her statement true?

105
00:05:53,270 --> 00:05:55,270
I... guess so.

106
00:05:55,870 --> 00:05:57,240
What reason did she have to tell

107
00:05:57,240 --> 00:05:58,040
a massive lie?

108
00:05:58,270 --> 00:05:59,000
What reason?

109
00:05:59,680 --> 00:06:01,610
To spite her in-laws, that's what.

110
00:06:01,750 --> 00:06:02,630
It's completely normal

111
00:06:02,630 --> 00:06:03,490
for rural women

112
00:06:03,510 --> 00:06:05,480
to stir up trouble and make things up.

113
00:06:05,480 --> 00:06:06,360
Mr. Wang,

114
00:06:06,550 --> 00:06:07,600
it's not fair to say that.

115
00:06:07,600 --> 00:06:08,800
We already warned her

116
00:06:09,270 --> 00:06:11,040
that lying would lead to
legal consequences.

117
00:06:11,040 --> 00:06:12,240
Legal consequences?

118
00:06:12,870 --> 00:06:14,330
Would she dare to testify?

119
00:06:14,800 --> 00:06:16,600
As a widow living with her kids
at her in-laws',

120
00:06:16,600 --> 00:06:17,480
would she dare to testify

121
00:06:17,480 --> 00:06:20,160
to any connection
between her man and Huang Liancang?

122
00:06:20,160 --> 00:06:20,960
You asked her,

123
00:06:21,160 --> 00:06:22,820
and she wouldn't dare, right?

124
00:06:25,190 --> 00:06:27,830
It's understandable that she has concerns.

125
00:06:28,430 --> 00:06:29,390
A widow makes up

126
00:06:29,680 --> 00:06:31,390
stories about her dead husband

127
00:06:31,390 --> 00:06:32,720
probably due to hatred.

128
00:06:33,480 --> 00:06:35,390
She got beaten all the time, didn't she?

129
00:06:35,390 --> 00:06:36,890
I bet she's just venting her anger.

130
00:06:36,890 --> 00:06:38,190
But when you get serious with her,

131
00:06:38,190 --> 00:06:38,630
see—

132
00:06:38,950 --> 00:06:40,360
she'd change her mind in no time.

133
00:06:40,360 --> 00:06:41,820
We've seen plenty of this.

134
00:06:42,920 --> 00:06:43,780
I beg to differ.

135
00:06:45,000 --> 00:06:47,260
You're making a subjective assumption.

136
00:06:47,290 --> 00:06:47,950
Well, look,

137
00:06:48,570 --> 00:06:50,370
Mr. Wang is highly experienced.

138
00:06:50,659 --> 00:06:52,990
The situation he mentioned truly exists.

139
00:06:53,120 --> 00:06:53,720
But...

140
00:06:53,800 --> 00:06:54,720
But what?

141
00:06:55,270 --> 00:06:56,510
What do you have to do with this?

142
00:06:56,510 --> 00:06:57,710
Don't you interfere.

143
00:07:03,070 --> 00:07:04,290
I'm being subjective?

144
00:07:04,290 --> 00:07:06,510
Aren't you also subjective
and opinionated?

145
00:07:06,510 --> 00:07:08,360
Qiu Agui's husband gambled.

146
00:07:08,680 --> 00:07:10,070
He lost and made his own daughter

147
00:07:10,070 --> 00:07:12,070
sleep with some guy to pay his debts.

148
00:07:12,160 --> 00:07:13,420
Now, both men are dead.

149
00:07:14,040 --> 00:07:14,770
Isn't it odd?

150
00:07:15,120 --> 00:07:16,580
Too much of a coincidence?

151
00:07:17,120 --> 00:07:18,380
Dead men tell no tales.

152
00:07:19,160 --> 00:07:20,800
We only have
the widow's side of the story,

153
00:07:20,800 --> 00:07:22,240
and she dares not testify.

154
00:07:22,240 --> 00:07:24,240
Qiu Agui herself never speaks of it.

155
00:07:24,400 --> 00:07:25,600
If you were the judge,

156
00:07:25,830 --> 00:07:27,030
would you believe it?

157
00:07:29,830 --> 00:07:31,430
So you killed Huang Liancang

158
00:07:31,680 --> 00:07:33,140
for the one and only reason

159
00:07:33,630 --> 00:07:34,680
that he beat you?

160
00:07:46,750 --> 00:07:47,390
Qiu Agui,

161
00:07:48,070 --> 00:07:49,190
your husband lost money gambling,

162
00:07:49,190 --> 00:07:50,720
so he decided to pay his debts by letting

163
00:07:50,720 --> 00:07:51,310
his poker buddy

164
00:07:51,310 --> 00:07:52,820
Feng Dazhi violate your daughter.

165
00:07:52,820 --> 00:07:53,920
In order to keep your daughter

166
00:07:53,920 --> 00:07:54,800
from further harm,

167
00:07:54,800 --> 00:07:56,120
you had no choice
but to kill your husband.

168
00:07:56,120 --> 00:07:56,920
Is it correct?

169
00:07:56,950 --> 00:07:57,600
No!

170
00:08:02,410 --> 00:08:03,240
How come at this point

171
00:08:03,240 --> 00:08:05,010
you still have no idea
of protecting yourself?

172
00:08:05,010 --> 00:08:06,190
Qiu Agui, think about it.

173
00:08:06,190 --> 00:08:06,920
If you die,

174
00:08:06,940 --> 00:08:09,400
-who will protect your daughter?
-Yingjie.

175
00:08:13,510 --> 00:08:14,710
Let me say this again:

176
00:08:14,830 --> 00:08:15,750
what you said didn't happen.

177
00:08:15,750 --> 00:08:17,550
Don't you ever speak of it again.

178
00:08:17,750 --> 00:08:18,310
Otherwise,

179
00:08:18,310 --> 00:08:19,040
I won't stop haunting you

180
00:08:19,040 --> 00:08:20,370
even if I become a ghost!

181
00:08:29,800 --> 00:08:30,530
Xia Yingjie,

182
00:08:31,260 --> 00:08:31,970
do you know

183
00:08:32,000 --> 00:08:32,840
who you are?

184
00:08:33,789 --> 00:08:35,450
All I know is that this is a fact

185
00:08:35,630 --> 00:08:37,240
that can save her life.

186
00:08:37,270 --> 00:08:38,480
But as a judge,

187
00:08:38,480 --> 00:08:40,100
there's one thing you must know:

188
00:08:40,100 --> 00:08:41,440
only facts recognized by the law

189
00:08:41,440 --> 00:08:42,240
are considered facts.

190
00:08:42,240 --> 00:08:42,860
Legally speaking,

191
00:08:42,860 --> 00:08:43,669
what cannot be proven

192
00:08:43,669 --> 00:08:44,930
simply didn't happen.

193
00:08:46,870 --> 00:08:47,930
I'm not a judge yet.

194
00:08:48,320 --> 00:08:50,250
But you're an officer of the court.

195
00:08:57,790 --> 00:08:59,250
Let's back up for a moment.

196
00:08:59,670 --> 00:09:01,200
If the story is proven true,

197
00:09:01,320 --> 00:09:03,120
then morally speaking, there's some

198
00:09:03,120 --> 00:09:05,000
justification
for Qiu Agui's act of killing,

199
00:09:05,000 --> 00:09:06,150
though it doesn't

200
00:09:06,600 --> 00:09:08,530
constitute justifiable defense.

201
00:09:09,140 --> 00:09:10,870
It's not encouraged by the law,

202
00:09:14,390 --> 00:09:15,990
but it should be understood.

203
00:09:17,390 --> 00:09:19,720
This is a major mitigating circumstance.

204
00:09:20,270 --> 00:09:22,200
You've got all the way down to that.

205
00:09:22,550 --> 00:09:24,210
What else is there to discuss?

206
00:09:25,750 --> 00:09:27,010
Let's leave it at that.

207
00:09:27,190 --> 00:09:28,120
We're very busy.

208
00:09:33,840 --> 00:09:35,440
This is indeed a tricky case.

209
00:09:36,000 --> 00:09:37,480
But what if it's turned around?

210
00:09:37,480 --> 00:09:38,440
If you turn the case around,

211
00:09:38,440 --> 00:09:40,020
you'll be immortalized in history,

212
00:09:40,020 --> 00:09:40,620
won't you?

213
00:09:41,700 --> 00:09:42,560
How about this?

214
00:09:43,440 --> 00:09:45,670
I'll try talking the higher-ups
into letting you

215
00:09:45,670 --> 00:09:46,270
handle it,

216
00:09:46,360 --> 00:09:47,630
so you'll be immortalized in history

217
00:09:47,630 --> 00:09:48,840
and even make the news.

218
00:09:48,840 --> 00:09:49,840
Go ahead and do it.

219
00:09:49,870 --> 00:09:50,840
Tell the higher-ups.

220
00:09:50,840 --> 00:09:51,630
See if I'll rise to fame.

221
00:09:51,630 --> 00:09:52,560
Leave. Let's go.

222
00:09:53,080 --> 00:09:55,000
And he calls himself a legal advisor.

223
00:09:55,000 --> 00:09:55,870
So full of attitude.

224
00:09:55,870 --> 00:09:56,640
Sorry.

225
00:10:01,360 --> 00:10:03,020
Maybe we shouldn't have come.

226
00:10:06,200 --> 00:10:07,460
Sorry for the trouble.

227
00:10:15,960 --> 00:10:17,560
Have the electric fan fixed!

228
00:10:28,440 --> 00:10:31,420
[Court President's Office]

229
00:10:31,080 --> 00:10:31,610
How about

230
00:10:31,940 --> 00:10:33,470
the court returns the files

231
00:10:34,410 --> 00:10:35,960
and asks the procuratorate to conduct

232
00:10:35,960 --> 00:10:36,570
a supplementary

233
00:10:36,570 --> 00:10:37,830
investigation, Ding?

234
00:10:40,270 --> 00:10:42,030
A supplementary investigation?

235
00:10:42,030 --> 00:10:42,750
On what?

236
00:10:46,000 --> 00:10:46,600
As of now,

237
00:10:47,670 --> 00:10:48,670
the only witness

238
00:10:49,910 --> 00:10:51,240
is Qiu Agui's daughter.

239
00:10:52,360 --> 00:10:53,690
But she's still a minor.

240
00:10:54,550 --> 00:10:56,390
Are you suggesting
the police and procuratorate

241
00:10:56,390 --> 00:10:57,450
ask the child this,

242
00:10:58,220 --> 00:10:59,440
"did your father make you

243
00:10:59,440 --> 00:11:00,670
sleep with some guy?"

244
00:11:03,320 --> 00:11:04,870
Do you wish to see

245
00:11:04,960 --> 00:11:06,760
the child's testimony in court?

246
00:11:07,080 --> 00:11:08,940
I'm telling you, if that happens,

247
00:11:10,040 --> 00:11:11,170
in all probability,

248
00:11:11,200 --> 00:11:11,870
not only

249
00:11:12,390 --> 00:11:13,920
will Qiu Agui lose her life,

250
00:11:14,400 --> 00:11:15,750
but also the child will bear

251
00:11:15,750 --> 00:11:16,810
a stain on her life.

252
00:11:17,520 --> 00:11:18,360
You think Qiu Agui would

253
00:11:18,360 --> 00:11:19,690
like to see that happen?

254
00:11:20,150 --> 00:11:22,880
That way, her sacrifice
will be i-in vain, right?

255
00:11:23,240 --> 00:11:23,870
But, Ding,

256
00:11:24,240 --> 00:11:25,900
even before the trial starts,

257
00:11:26,000 --> 00:11:27,360
we've sentenced her to death.

258
00:11:27,360 --> 00:11:28,820
Do you think this is right?

259
00:11:28,910 --> 00:11:29,370
Enough.

260
00:11:30,270 --> 00:11:30,730
Shumei,

261
00:11:31,000 --> 00:11:31,730
listen to me.

262
00:11:32,320 --> 00:11:33,270
If you really can't

263
00:11:33,270 --> 00:11:35,000
bring yourself to go on with it,

264
00:11:37,080 --> 00:11:39,680
we'll have someone else
preside with the case.

265
00:11:44,270 --> 00:11:45,930
What difference does it make?

266
00:11:47,870 --> 00:11:49,200
How else to approach it?

267
00:11:50,030 --> 00:11:51,960
Given the current circumstances,

268
00:11:53,720 --> 00:11:54,920
how about we say it is I

269
00:11:55,390 --> 00:11:57,320
who instructs you to make a ruling?

270
00:11:58,000 --> 00:11:59,400
Let me be the bad guy then.

271
00:12:01,630 --> 00:12:03,360
Will that make you feel better?

272
00:12:04,240 --> 00:12:04,670
Ding,

273
00:12:05,630 --> 00:12:08,030
I just think there are justifiable reasons

274
00:12:08,890 --> 00:12:11,340
for Qiu Agui to live!

275
00:12:13,200 --> 00:12:15,660
The court president withheld his opinions?

276
00:12:15,720 --> 00:12:17,520
His top concerns are not the law,

277
00:12:17,740 --> 00:12:19,170
but social stability,

278
00:12:19,200 --> 00:12:20,870
calls from the county government,

279
00:12:20,870 --> 00:12:22,150
and his own job.

280
00:12:24,440 --> 00:12:25,770
What about the lawyers?

281
00:12:26,630 --> 00:12:27,360
Gloomy, too.

282
00:12:28,150 --> 00:12:29,210
If the lawyers tell

283
00:12:29,640 --> 00:12:30,550
all those stories

284
00:12:30,550 --> 00:12:31,840
in court,

285
00:12:32,030 --> 00:12:33,290
it should work, right?

286
00:12:34,150 --> 00:12:36,010
Even God can't do anything to help

287
00:12:36,320 --> 00:12:38,050
if Qiu Agui denies everything.

288
00:12:39,120 --> 00:12:40,980
How about we talk to her daughter?

289
00:12:41,120 --> 00:12:41,750
Let's first try

290
00:12:41,750 --> 00:12:43,350
to resolve this internally.

291
00:12:46,790 --> 00:12:47,390
Anyway, we can't

292
00:12:47,390 --> 00:12:48,920
sit back and do nothing now.

293
00:12:51,630 --> 00:12:53,690
Let's try to persuade Li Xiang again.

294
00:12:54,510 --> 00:12:55,080
Yes, him.

295
00:12:55,620 --> 00:12:56,320
He strikes me as a man

296
00:12:56,320 --> 00:12:57,650
with a sense of justice.

297
00:12:58,550 --> 00:13:00,390
We'll go to the procuratorate then.

298
00:13:00,390 --> 00:13:01,030
It's essentially

299
00:13:01,030 --> 00:13:02,500
their duty to find out the truth.

300
00:13:02,500 --> 00:13:03,200
But we don't know anyone

301
00:13:03,200 --> 00:13:04,460
in the procuratorate.

302
00:13:04,840 --> 00:13:06,000
What does that matter?

303
00:13:06,000 --> 00:13:07,440
Let's march straight to it.

304
00:13:07,440 --> 00:13:08,570
It's just upstairs.

305
00:13:22,870 --> 00:13:23,440
Li Xiang.

306
00:13:24,840 --> 00:13:26,300
Why can't you understand?

307
00:13:26,320 --> 00:13:27,780
They're college students

308
00:13:27,790 --> 00:13:29,190
doing internships here.

309
00:13:29,840 --> 00:13:30,510
Before long,

310
00:13:30,510 --> 00:13:32,170
they will get back to Beijing.

311
00:13:32,600 --> 00:13:33,390
Do you even know

312
00:13:33,390 --> 00:13:35,190
the public opinion on this case?

313
00:13:40,480 --> 00:13:41,410
Be that as it may,

314
00:13:42,320 --> 00:13:43,780
we're Qiu Agui's lawyers.

315
00:13:44,030 --> 00:13:45,150
Who are we being fair to

316
00:13:45,150 --> 00:13:46,120
if we go to court

317
00:13:46,370 --> 00:13:47,440
without meeting her even once?

318
00:13:47,440 --> 00:13:50,170
Being fair to ourselves
would be enough already.

319
00:13:51,240 --> 00:13:52,170
I'm warning you.

320
00:13:52,600 --> 00:13:53,720
Try not to end up displeasing both sides

321
00:13:53,720 --> 00:13:55,120
and getting in a dilemma.

322
00:14:01,790 --> 00:14:02,650
Will you join me

323
00:14:03,030 --> 00:14:03,960
in meeting Qiu Agui?

324
00:14:03,960 --> 00:14:04,270
No.

325
00:14:04,910 --> 00:14:05,660
I will.

326
00:14:09,960 --> 00:14:12,080
I will g-go fetch some hot water.

327
00:14:19,770 --> 00:14:21,120
You've waited for a while, huh?

328
00:14:21,120 --> 00:14:21,650
Let's go.

329
00:14:22,080 --> 00:14:23,210
Off to meet Qiu Agui.

330
00:14:23,480 --> 00:14:23,830
Let's go.

331
00:14:23,830 --> 00:14:24,160
Sure.

332
00:14:30,480 --> 00:14:31,540
Chief Prosecutor.

333
00:14:32,030 --> 00:14:32,870
They are asking us

334
00:14:32,870 --> 00:14:34,930
to conduct a further investigation.

335
00:14:34,950 --> 00:14:36,480
Have they taken our advice?

336
00:14:36,760 --> 00:14:37,360
Off you go.

337
00:14:38,360 --> 00:14:39,220
Here she comes.

338
00:14:42,720 --> 00:14:43,750
The chief prosecutor

339
00:14:43,750 --> 00:14:45,280
appreciates your concern.

340
00:14:45,360 --> 00:14:46,390
Regarding this matter,

341
00:14:46,390 --> 00:14:47,200
we will communicate with

342
00:14:47,200 --> 00:14:48,130
the court again.

343
00:14:51,000 --> 00:14:51,800
And then what?

344
00:14:52,360 --> 00:14:53,290
"And then what"?

345
00:14:54,440 --> 00:14:55,480
As I just told you,

346
00:14:55,910 --> 00:14:56,750
we will communicate with

347
00:14:56,750 --> 00:14:57,680
the court again.

348
00:14:58,870 --> 00:14:59,270
But...

349
00:15:02,550 --> 00:15:03,750
Chief Prosecutor Guan,

350
00:15:03,750 --> 00:15:04,150
you...

351
00:15:06,250 --> 00:15:06,970
I heard

352
00:15:07,000 --> 00:15:08,130
your conversation.

353
00:15:08,130 --> 00:15:08,930
Rest assured.

354
00:15:09,030 --> 00:15:09,670
We promise

355
00:15:09,690 --> 00:15:11,550
to get to the bottom of this matter.

356
00:15:11,550 --> 00:15:12,550
Chief Prosecutor Guan,

357
00:15:12,550 --> 00:15:13,480
we rashly came find you

358
00:15:13,480 --> 00:15:15,200
since this matter is of great importance.

359
00:15:15,200 --> 00:15:16,120
A perfunctory ruling

360
00:15:16,120 --> 00:15:16,870
will lead to nothing

361
00:15:16,870 --> 00:15:18,030
but the unjust death
of a mother who tries to

362
00:15:18,030 --> 00:15:18,790
protect her children.

363
00:15:18,790 --> 00:15:20,200
And those poor children

364
00:15:20,500 --> 00:15:21,170
will be

365
00:15:21,200 --> 00:15:22,330
reduced to orphans.

366
00:15:22,720 --> 00:15:25,180
Moreover, truth will be completely buried.

367
00:15:25,240 --> 00:15:26,170
I am begging you.

368
00:15:26,390 --> 00:15:27,150
Please

369
00:15:27,600 --> 00:15:28,860
give Qiu Agui a chance.

370
00:15:32,510 --> 00:15:33,870
What if I give her one more chance

371
00:15:33,870 --> 00:15:34,720
and she still

372
00:15:34,720 --> 00:15:35,380
won't talk?

373
00:15:37,510 --> 00:15:38,030
You are all

374
00:15:38,030 --> 00:15:39,360
top-tier law students.

375
00:15:39,840 --> 00:15:40,700
You should know

376
00:15:41,390 --> 00:15:43,000
that any sympathy driven by

377
00:15:43,030 --> 00:15:44,360
emotional inclination

378
00:15:44,360 --> 00:15:45,820
has no evidentiary value.

379
00:15:50,360 --> 00:15:52,160
Thanks, Chief Prosecutor Guan.

380
00:15:52,480 --> 00:15:53,200
Hold on.

381
00:15:55,000 --> 00:15:56,550
You're... Zhang Lihui?

382
00:15:57,080 --> 00:15:57,440
Yes.

383
00:15:59,060 --> 00:15:59,840
In fact, among

384
00:15:59,840 --> 00:16:01,120
this batch of students,

385
00:16:01,120 --> 00:16:03,600
you and Chen Yizhong
left quite a deep impression

386
00:16:03,600 --> 00:16:04,320
on me.

387
00:16:04,790 --> 00:16:06,870
Compassionate yet principled.

388
00:16:07,360 --> 00:16:07,960
You see,

389
00:16:08,750 --> 00:16:11,200
now, the crew of prosecutors

390
00:16:11,550 --> 00:16:13,010
is in need of young members

391
00:16:13,320 --> 00:16:14,720
like you, who can keep

392
00:16:14,910 --> 00:16:16,360
their composure

393
00:16:16,480 --> 00:16:17,740
and assert authority.

394
00:16:20,960 --> 00:16:22,390
You're graduating soon, right?

395
00:16:22,390 --> 00:16:22,750
Yes.

396
00:16:24,000 --> 00:16:25,330
Think about joining us.

397
00:16:25,550 --> 00:16:26,000
Sure.

398
00:16:26,440 --> 00:16:27,040
Thank you.

399
00:16:27,600 --> 00:16:28,200
Thank you.

400
00:16:40,270 --> 00:16:40,790
How did it go?

401
00:16:40,790 --> 00:16:41,990
Did Qiu Agui admit it?

402
00:16:42,550 --> 00:16:44,210
No, she vehemently denied it.

403
00:16:44,270 --> 00:16:44,910
She also forbade me

404
00:16:44,910 --> 00:16:46,270
from bringing it up in court.

405
00:16:46,270 --> 00:16:47,200
She said if I did,

406
00:16:47,270 --> 00:16:49,020
she'd hunt me down even as a ghost.

407
00:16:49,020 --> 00:16:50,080
Even without that element,

408
00:16:50,080 --> 00:16:51,170
it still remains a fact that she was

409
00:16:51,170 --> 00:16:52,120
abused for a long time.

410
00:16:52,120 --> 00:16:52,870
Will it help if you

411
00:16:52,870 --> 00:16:53,530
put up a proper defense

412
00:16:53,530 --> 00:16:54,460
from this angle?

413
00:16:55,360 --> 00:16:55,840
Lu,

414
00:16:56,630 --> 00:16:57,320
are you teaching me

415
00:16:57,320 --> 00:16:58,320
how to be a lawyer?

416
00:16:58,630 --> 00:16:59,200
No, no.

417
00:16:59,510 --> 00:17:00,550
We don't mean that.

418
00:17:00,550 --> 00:17:01,810
Lu's just too worried.

419
00:17:05,720 --> 00:17:07,119
I'll surely do my utmost.

420
00:17:07,829 --> 00:17:10,089
But judging from the current situation,

421
00:17:10,510 --> 00:17:12,240
a death penalty is a certainty.

422
00:17:12,790 --> 00:17:14,069
Not to mention the huge impact

423
00:17:14,069 --> 00:17:15,329
of this case right now.

424
00:17:15,829 --> 00:17:17,829
Qiu's in-laws just won't back down.

425
00:17:18,640 --> 00:17:20,440
Is there anything else we can do?

426
00:17:21,790 --> 00:17:22,680
No, nothing.

427
00:17:23,440 --> 00:17:25,099
This is what the world is like.

428
00:17:25,200 --> 00:17:26,069
Not every problem

429
00:17:26,069 --> 00:17:26,930
has a solution.

430
00:17:27,790 --> 00:17:29,160
In my years as a lawyer,

431
00:17:30,160 --> 00:17:31,690
this is what I feel deepest:

432
00:17:33,350 --> 00:17:34,010
powerless.

433
00:17:40,000 --> 00:17:41,730
I have an announcement to make.

434
00:17:41,750 --> 00:17:42,440
That case

435
00:17:43,270 --> 00:17:44,730
must go to trial tomorrow.

436
00:17:52,270 --> 00:17:54,070
Qiu Agui was interrogated again,

437
00:17:54,070 --> 00:17:56,000
but she firmly denied everything.

438
00:18:03,110 --> 00:18:04,310
The trial starts tomorrow.

439
00:18:04,310 --> 00:18:05,560
It's non-negotiable.

440
00:18:05,560 --> 00:18:06,420
The location is

441
00:18:06,790 --> 00:18:08,790
the county government auditorium.

442
00:18:24,310 --> 00:18:24,880
Mentor.

443
00:18:25,480 --> 00:18:26,680
Don't call me Mentor.

444
00:18:29,000 --> 00:18:30,060
I don't deserve it.

445
00:19:24,790 --> 00:19:25,850
Is anyone in there?

446
00:19:29,960 --> 00:19:31,020
I'm from the court.

447
00:19:33,310 --> 00:19:34,170
I remember you.

448
00:19:34,790 --> 00:19:35,720
What do you want?

449
00:19:48,310 --> 00:19:48,680
I...

450
00:19:50,200 --> 00:19:51,060
I want nothing.

451
00:19:51,590 --> 00:19:52,880
I was just passing by.

452
00:20:14,640 --> 00:20:15,900
It's pouring outside.

453
00:20:16,440 --> 00:20:17,840
Come in and take shelter!

454
00:20:38,070 --> 00:20:38,670
Thank you.

455
00:20:43,830 --> 00:20:44,690
How old are you?

456
00:20:45,160 --> 00:20:46,270
I'm 14 years old.

457
00:20:50,590 --> 00:20:51,320
Comrade Xia,

458
00:20:52,440 --> 00:20:53,880
if you have anything to say,

459
00:20:53,880 --> 00:20:54,720
say it now.

460
00:20:55,550 --> 00:20:57,440
Or it'll be too late, since the trial

461
00:20:57,440 --> 00:20:58,440
starts tomorrow.

462
00:20:59,160 --> 00:20:59,980
It's true that all women

463
00:20:59,980 --> 00:21:01,710
have endured a lot of hardship,

464
00:21:04,160 --> 00:21:05,030
but this child

465
00:21:06,720 --> 00:21:07,590
has really

466
00:21:10,070 --> 00:21:11,130
suffered too much.

467
00:22:37,480 --> 00:22:38,350
You know what?

468
00:22:39,110 --> 00:22:41,310
Sometimes I have a strong urge to swear.

469
00:22:41,920 --> 00:22:43,580
And I even want to hit someone.

470
00:22:45,590 --> 00:22:46,450
That I can tell.

471
00:22:46,960 --> 00:22:48,400
How about you yell at me,

472
00:22:49,030 --> 00:22:50,240
and then you hit me?

473
00:22:52,100 --> 00:22:52,810
I take that back.

474
00:22:52,810 --> 00:22:54,140
It's pretty dangerous.

475
00:23:01,440 --> 00:23:01,990
I...

476
00:23:04,270 --> 00:23:05,930
I can't bring myself to swear.

477
00:23:06,920 --> 00:23:07,980
Let me do it for you.

478
00:23:08,750 --> 00:23:10,510
Damn it!

479
00:23:11,160 --> 00:23:12,480
Damn it!

480
00:23:24,270 --> 00:23:25,400
Damn it!

481
00:23:25,640 --> 00:23:27,160
Damn it!

482
00:24:01,000 --> 00:24:02,830
Fang Shumei, come out here!

483
00:24:04,400 --> 00:24:05,630
My son's running a fever.

484
00:24:05,630 --> 00:24:07,110
How could you, as his mom,
leave him unattended

485
00:24:07,110 --> 00:24:08,910
and make me care for him instead?

486
00:24:10,400 --> 00:24:11,240
Fang Shumei!

487
00:24:12,000 --> 00:24:12,890
Come out here!

488
00:24:12,920 --> 00:24:13,580
Here I come!

489
00:24:15,200 --> 00:24:16,070
Why are you here?

490
00:24:16,070 --> 00:24:17,200
Did you drink again?

491
00:24:17,360 --> 00:24:18,080
Go home now.

492
00:24:18,110 --> 00:24:19,510
I have to go to the court right away.

493
00:24:19,510 --> 00:24:20,670
Quick. Go home now.

494
00:24:23,200 --> 00:24:24,260
What are you doing?

495
00:24:24,560 --> 00:24:26,040
My son's running a fever.

496
00:24:26,070 --> 00:24:27,130
What are you doing?

497
00:24:27,530 --> 00:24:28,590
What do you think you're doing?

498
00:24:28,590 --> 00:24:29,000
Hurry.

499
00:24:29,030 --> 00:24:29,640
Let go of me!

500
00:24:29,640 --> 00:24:30,270
Let go!

501
00:24:30,290 --> 00:24:31,310
How could you assault others?

502
00:24:31,310 --> 00:24:32,200
Leave me alone!

503
00:24:32,310 --> 00:24:33,640
Mind your own business!

504
00:24:34,310 --> 00:24:34,830
Stop!

505
00:24:34,850 --> 00:24:35,590
Are you alright?

506
00:24:35,590 --> 00:24:35,960
Go home with me.

507
00:24:35,960 --> 00:24:36,400
Xia.

508
00:24:36,640 --> 00:24:37,480
Xia, are you alright?

509
00:24:37,480 --> 00:24:38,510
Stop. Stop it now!

510
00:24:38,530 --> 00:24:39,270
Why did you have to drink?

511
00:24:39,270 --> 00:24:39,790
Stop!

512
00:24:41,030 --> 00:24:41,880
What do you think

513
00:24:41,880 --> 00:24:42,680
you are doing?

514
00:24:42,720 --> 00:24:43,720
What are you up to?

515
00:24:43,750 --> 00:24:44,640
Where do you think you are?

516
00:24:44,640 --> 00:24:45,240
Court Pres. Ding,

517
00:24:45,240 --> 00:24:46,000
h-he just drank...

518
00:24:46,000 --> 00:24:46,550
Shut up!

519
00:24:48,830 --> 00:24:50,230
Do you know where you are?

520
00:24:50,400 --> 00:24:51,070
What's this place?

521
00:24:51,070 --> 00:24:51,680
Let's stay away.

522
00:24:51,680 --> 00:24:52,550
This is a county court,

523
00:24:52,550 --> 00:24:54,160
a state judicial organ.

524
00:24:54,720 --> 00:24:56,000
But you attacked my people

525
00:24:56,000 --> 00:24:57,440
and precious college students here.

526
00:24:57,440 --> 00:24:58,510
You are way out of line!

527
00:24:58,510 --> 00:24:59,550
Court Pres. Ding, he's drunk.

528
00:24:59,550 --> 00:25:00,950
Y-You don't get to speak!

529
00:25:03,720 --> 00:25:04,880
She's my wife,

530
00:25:06,160 --> 00:25:06,960
so she's mine.

531
00:25:07,400 --> 00:25:08,930
Everyone here is my people!

532
00:25:09,960 --> 00:25:11,160
Talent for the state!

533
00:25:12,160 --> 00:25:14,690
I can have you executed.
You believe it or not?

534
00:25:18,880 --> 00:25:19,810
Go home already.

535
00:25:20,160 --> 00:25:20,560
Hurry.

536
00:25:22,240 --> 00:25:22,840
Off you go!

537
00:25:23,310 --> 00:25:24,570
The trial starts soon.

538
00:25:25,690 --> 00:25:26,620
Just go home now.

539
00:25:26,640 --> 00:25:27,590
Get a move on!

540
00:25:32,350 --> 00:25:32,750
What?

541
00:25:33,590 --> 00:25:34,990
Haven't you seen enough?

542
00:25:42,510 --> 00:25:43,370
Get out of here.

543
00:25:45,240 --> 00:25:46,350
Stay as far as possible.

544
00:25:46,350 --> 00:25:46,790
Got it?

545
00:25:50,030 --> 00:25:51,640
Mentor, how are you holding up?

546
00:25:51,640 --> 00:25:52,500
I'm doing fine.

547
00:25:53,790 --> 00:25:54,310
Xia,

548
00:25:54,960 --> 00:25:55,890
are you alright?

549
00:25:57,400 --> 00:25:58,030
I'm sorry.

550
00:25:58,680 --> 00:25:59,540
Don't say that.

551
00:26:03,000 --> 00:26:03,800
Put this away.

552
00:26:04,110 --> 00:26:04,510
Yes.

553
00:26:07,640 --> 00:26:08,570
Are you nervous?

554
00:26:11,830 --> 00:26:13,090
You will get used to it.

555
00:26:13,480 --> 00:26:14,480
Put this away too.

556
00:26:15,000 --> 00:26:15,510
Mentor,

557
00:26:16,030 --> 00:26:17,090
is this the only way

558
00:26:17,480 --> 00:26:19,080
Qiu Agui's case going to end?

559
00:26:22,840 --> 00:26:24,240
The county auditorium is cleared today

560
00:26:24,240 --> 00:26:25,770
for us to use as a courtroom.

561
00:26:26,750 --> 00:26:28,280
Do you know what that means?

562
00:26:31,790 --> 00:26:32,350
Be quick.

563
00:26:46,590 --> 00:26:48,550
[Defendant]

564
00:26:49,480 --> 00:26:50,010
Stand up!

565
00:26:53,590 --> 00:26:55,120
Fang Shumei and Xia Yingjie

566
00:26:55,200 --> 00:26:56,160
seem a bit off.

567
00:26:56,350 --> 00:26:58,680
Did they get into a fight,
the mentor and the mentee?

568
00:26:58,680 --> 00:27:00,590
Xia Yingjie can't be that reckless,
can she?

569
00:27:00,590 --> 00:27:01,190
Be seated.

570
00:27:03,400 --> 00:27:05,370
In the case of Nanyu County
People's Procuratorate

571
00:27:05,370 --> 00:27:09,980
[Presiding Judge]

572
00:27:05,480 --> 00:27:07,350
versus Qiu Agui for intentional homicide,

573
00:27:07,350 --> 00:27:08,680
court is now in session.

574
00:27:09,240 --> 00:27:10,570
Bring in the defendant.

575
00:27:14,680 --> 00:27:16,140
Murderers deserve to die!

576
00:27:24,160 --> 00:27:25,000
Order! Order!

577
00:27:26,880 --> 00:27:28,030
She's a murderer!

578
00:27:28,400 --> 00:27:29,460
Order in the court!

579
00:27:29,480 --> 00:27:31,080
You'll die a terrible death!

580
00:27:33,590 --> 00:27:34,120
Sit down!

581
00:27:34,730 --> 00:27:35,200
Sit down!

582
00:27:35,200 --> 00:27:36,310
Be seated, all of you.

583
00:27:36,310 --> 00:27:37,480
What a vile woman!

584
00:27:57,460 --> 00:27:59,330
Given that the defendant

585
00:27:59,640 --> 00:28:00,970
was always law-abiding

586
00:28:01,110 --> 00:28:02,040
and submissive,

587
00:28:02,440 --> 00:28:05,110
that this is her first offense
and an isolated incident, that she showed

588
00:28:05,110 --> 00:28:05,970
a good attitude

589
00:28:06,110 --> 00:28:08,100
in admitting her guilt after her arrest,

590
00:28:08,100 --> 00:28:10,550
and that she truthfully confessed
to all her criminal acts...

591
00:28:10,550 --> 00:28:12,080
How dare you spew nonsense!

592
00:28:13,480 --> 00:28:14,630
You damn bastard!

593
00:28:15,240 --> 00:28:15,590
What's this about?

594
00:28:15,590 --> 00:28:16,110
Liar!

595
00:28:16,310 --> 00:28:17,160
You'll die a horrible death!

596
00:28:17,160 --> 00:28:17,970
What's all this about?

597
00:28:17,970 --> 00:28:19,070
You're no good either!

598
00:28:19,070 --> 00:28:19,530
Get out!

599
00:28:20,680 --> 00:28:22,280
You'll die a horrible death!

600
00:28:22,310 --> 00:28:23,310
You damn bastard!

601
00:28:23,480 --> 00:28:25,080
You'll die a horrible death!

602
00:28:25,170 --> 00:28:26,200
We humbly implore the court

603
00:28:26,200 --> 00:28:27,750
to be lenient on the defendant,

604
00:28:27,750 --> 00:28:28,880
in light of her role as a mother

605
00:28:28,880 --> 00:28:30,510
supporting three underaged children.

606
00:28:30,510 --> 00:28:31,110
What are you doing?

607
00:28:31,110 --> 00:28:31,400
Good!

608
00:28:31,400 --> 00:28:33,060
-Serves him right!
-Good one!

609
00:28:33,480 --> 00:28:34,000
Quiet!

610
00:28:34,440 --> 00:28:35,270
Well done!

611
00:28:35,640 --> 00:28:36,400
Discipline!

612
00:28:37,030 --> 00:28:38,030
Back to your seat!

613
00:28:38,350 --> 00:28:39,210
I won't wipe it.

614
00:28:39,510 --> 00:28:40,440
I'll leave it on!

615
00:28:40,990 --> 00:28:42,250
Are you satisfied now?

616
00:28:44,550 --> 00:28:45,920
Good for Wang Benshan.

617
00:28:46,000 --> 00:28:47,270
He's acting like a real man.

618
00:28:47,270 --> 00:28:49,130
How were those things brought in?

619
00:28:50,010 --> 00:28:51,240
Whoever disrupts the court order

620
00:28:51,240 --> 00:28:52,090
will be removed.

621
00:28:52,090 --> 00:28:53,490
Have I made myself clear?

622
00:29:02,570 --> 00:29:04,120
[Defendant]

623
00:29:03,110 --> 00:29:03,640
Li Xiang.

624
00:29:04,310 --> 00:29:05,440
You saw that, right?

625
00:29:07,310 --> 00:29:08,910
Wake up, Tolstoy.

626
00:29:11,790 --> 00:29:12,450
Defendant,

627
00:29:13,750 --> 00:29:15,280
the indictment charges you

628
00:29:15,550 --> 00:29:18,070
with the murder
of your husband, Huang Liancang.

629
00:29:18,070 --> 00:29:19,200
Do you plead guilty?

630
00:29:23,750 --> 00:29:24,880
Yes, I plead guilty.

631
00:29:25,240 --> 00:29:27,040
I'm prepared to die for his life.

632
00:29:27,480 --> 00:29:28,750
I only ask for my three children

633
00:29:28,750 --> 00:29:30,080
to be taken good care of.

634
00:29:31,240 --> 00:29:33,240
How dare you talk about the kids!

635
00:29:33,590 --> 00:29:34,790
Those in the gallery,

636
00:29:35,000 --> 00:29:36,160
without my permission,

637
00:29:36,160 --> 00:29:37,160
you may not speak.

638
00:29:37,440 --> 00:29:38,700
Take this as a warning.

639
00:29:42,030 --> 00:29:42,590
Qiu Agui,

640
00:29:43,590 --> 00:29:44,440
you and your husband

641
00:29:44,440 --> 00:29:46,170
were married for over 10 years,

642
00:29:46,350 --> 00:29:47,880
and you had three children.

643
00:29:48,030 --> 00:29:50,110
How could you bring yourself to kill him?

644
00:29:50,110 --> 00:29:51,310
What was your motive?

645
00:29:52,070 --> 00:29:52,350
I...

646
00:29:52,350 --> 00:29:54,010
Are you doing this on purpose?

647
00:29:54,550 --> 00:29:56,480
What are you trying to get out of her?

648
00:29:56,480 --> 00:29:58,760
Are you secretly helping her?

649
00:29:58,790 --> 00:30:00,390
This is your second warning!

650
00:30:08,480 --> 00:30:09,070
Qiu Agui,

651
00:30:09,640 --> 00:30:10,840
answer the question.

652
00:30:15,790 --> 00:30:17,050
Huang Liancang beat me

653
00:30:17,480 --> 00:30:18,480
every single day,

654
00:30:19,160 --> 00:30:21,350
when he was happy or unhappy,

655
00:30:22,400 --> 00:30:23,400
when he was drunk,

656
00:30:24,160 --> 00:30:25,960
and when he lost money gambling.

657
00:30:27,070 --> 00:30:29,400
He not only beat me,
but also our children.

658
00:30:30,000 --> 00:30:31,000
So much so that we trembled

659
00:30:31,000 --> 00:30:32,460
simply at the sight of him.

660
00:30:33,680 --> 00:30:35,340
At that rate, we would've been

661
00:30:35,440 --> 00:30:36,700
beaten to death by him.

662
00:30:37,720 --> 00:30:38,510
Nonsense!

663
00:30:39,010 --> 00:30:40,350
You're making nonsense!

664
00:30:40,350 --> 00:30:41,070
Be seated!

665
00:30:42,240 --> 00:30:43,440
If you disrupt the court order again,

666
00:30:43,440 --> 00:30:44,350
I will have you removed.

667
00:30:44,350 --> 00:30:45,150
Do you hear me?

668
00:30:46,030 --> 00:30:47,490
This is your last warning.

669
00:30:48,550 --> 00:30:49,680
Defendant Qiu Agui,

670
00:30:50,000 --> 00:30:51,790
you said your husband abused you.

671
00:30:51,790 --> 00:30:53,120
Is there any proof of it?

672
00:31:28,200 --> 00:31:30,550
Men all beat their wives, don't they?

673
00:31:31,400 --> 00:31:33,110
Should a man die
for just beating his wife?

674
00:31:33,110 --> 00:31:33,750
Get her out!

675
00:31:33,750 --> 00:31:35,830
This is unfair!

676
00:31:36,270 --> 00:31:37,550
This is unjust!

677
00:31:37,640 --> 00:31:38,030
I...

678
00:31:38,170 --> 00:31:38,550
Get out!

679
00:31:38,550 --> 00:31:40,200
I... I will stop yelling.

680
00:31:40,750 --> 00:31:41,790
-I will.
-Wait!

681
00:31:44,150 --> 00:31:46,070
Considering you are the victim's family,

682
00:31:46,070 --> 00:31:47,600
I'll let it slide this time.

683
00:31:47,720 --> 00:31:49,580
But I won't tolerate it next time.

684
00:31:50,110 --> 00:31:51,170
Do you understand?

685
00:31:52,240 --> 00:31:53,900
I'm asking if you understand.

686
00:31:54,160 --> 00:31:55,240
Yes, I understand.

687
00:31:56,400 --> 00:31:57,120
Be seated.

688
00:31:58,920 --> 00:32:00,580
Defendant Qiu Agui, you claim

689
00:32:00,680 --> 00:32:01,920
your husband abused you.

690
00:32:01,920 --> 00:32:03,650
Besides the scars on your body,

691
00:32:04,270 --> 00:32:05,870
is there any other evidence?

692
00:32:10,550 --> 00:32:11,030
No.

693
00:32:17,550 --> 00:32:18,550
Defense counsel,

694
00:32:19,110 --> 00:32:20,030
do you have any evidence

695
00:32:20,030 --> 00:32:22,560
of the defendant being abused
by her husband?

696
00:32:23,480 --> 00:32:24,790
All we have here is a copy

697
00:32:24,790 --> 00:32:25,850
of the indictment.

698
00:32:26,250 --> 00:32:27,240
But the prosecutor's evidence materials

699
00:32:27,240 --> 00:32:28,640
include relevant proof.

700
00:32:29,110 --> 00:32:30,750
Please present the evidence.

701
00:32:30,750 --> 00:32:32,480
Exhibit No. 8 is the defedant's

702
00:32:32,640 --> 00:32:33,640
medical records.

703
00:32:34,110 --> 00:32:34,970
They prove

704
00:32:35,000 --> 00:32:36,920
that the defendant was hospitalized
three times

705
00:32:36,920 --> 00:32:38,350
for injuries caused by beatings.

706
00:32:38,350 --> 00:32:40,160
Based on what she told the doctors,

707
00:32:40,160 --> 00:32:41,820
she was beaten by her husband.

708
00:32:41,880 --> 00:32:43,740
Exhibit No. 9 is a testimony given

709
00:32:43,750 --> 00:32:45,950
by Huangping Town Women's Federation,

710
00:32:46,130 --> 00:32:47,200
proving that the defendant

711
00:32:47,200 --> 00:32:49,500
sought help from the institute twice
for being beaten

712
00:32:49,500 --> 00:32:50,780
by her husband.

713
00:32:51,230 --> 00:32:52,530
In response, the Women's Federation

714
00:32:52,530 --> 00:32:54,130
talked to her husband twice.

715
00:32:54,350 --> 00:32:55,970
Exhibit No. 10 is three pledges

716
00:32:55,970 --> 00:32:57,240
written by the victim Huang Liancang

717
00:32:57,240 --> 00:32:59,030
at Shangliang Villagers' Committee,

718
00:32:59,030 --> 00:32:59,830
in all of which

719
00:33:00,200 --> 00:33:01,000
he admitted to

720
00:33:01,000 --> 00:33:02,260
beating the defendant

721
00:33:02,440 --> 00:33:04,240
and promised never to do it again.

722
00:33:04,240 --> 00:33:06,040
Defendant and defense lawyers,

723
00:33:06,110 --> 00:33:07,170
do you acknowledge

724
00:33:07,440 --> 00:33:08,840
the evidence mentioned?

725
00:33:08,920 --> 00:33:09,640
Yes, we do.

726
00:33:14,440 --> 00:33:15,100
Defendant,

727
00:33:16,070 --> 00:33:18,240
did you call the police for being abused

728
00:33:18,240 --> 00:33:19,170
by your husband?

729
00:33:23,240 --> 00:33:23,840
No, never.

730
00:33:24,720 --> 00:33:25,310
Why?

731
00:33:26,200 --> 00:33:27,720
I turned to the villagers' committee

732
00:33:27,720 --> 00:33:29,780
and the Women's Federation for help.

733
00:33:29,830 --> 00:33:31,090
After every time I did,

734
00:33:31,790 --> 00:33:33,190
he'd beat me even harder.

735
00:33:34,640 --> 00:33:36,110
S-So I got scared.

736
00:33:37,000 --> 00:33:38,240
What was he like

737
00:33:38,750 --> 00:33:39,880
when you killed him?

738
00:33:40,550 --> 00:33:41,680
He got drunk again

739
00:33:42,200 --> 00:33:43,130
and fell asleep.

740
00:33:44,370 --> 00:33:45,400
I wouldn't have been able

741
00:33:45,400 --> 00:33:47,110
to kill him if he hadn't been asleep,

742
00:33:47,110 --> 00:33:48,970
since I was no match for him at all.

743
00:33:50,110 --> 00:33:51,840
He weighed over 100 kilograms,

744
00:33:52,070 --> 00:33:53,530
and I weighed less than 50.

745
00:33:59,160 --> 00:34:00,830
This concludes the court investigation.

746
00:34:00,830 --> 00:34:01,960
Presiding Judge...

747
00:34:02,350 --> 00:34:03,350
What are you up to?

748
00:34:03,350 --> 00:34:04,960
They're going to throw cabbage at you.

749
00:34:04,960 --> 00:34:07,160
I have further submissions
to make in defense.

750
00:34:07,160 --> 00:34:07,690
Go ahead.

751
00:34:10,800 --> 00:34:13,000
It was doubtlessly wrong
for Qiu Agui to take a life,

752
00:34:13,000 --> 00:34:14,460
but she did it for a reason.

753
00:34:14,679 --> 00:34:15,590
All the evidence presented

754
00:34:15,590 --> 00:34:17,070
just now has already proved

755
00:34:17,070 --> 00:34:18,510
that the defendant suffered

756
00:34:18,510 --> 00:34:20,969
long-term and brutal abuse
from the victim.

757
00:34:21,850 --> 00:34:22,960
She must have run out of options

758
00:34:22,960 --> 00:34:23,710
when she decided to kill.

759
00:34:23,710 --> 00:34:24,960
How much did the murderer pay you?

760
00:34:24,960 --> 00:34:25,880
You'll rot in hell!

761
00:34:25,880 --> 00:34:26,360
Sit down!

762
00:34:26,360 --> 00:34:26,960
That's right!

763
00:34:26,960 --> 00:34:27,630
You'll rot in hell!

764
00:34:27,630 --> 00:34:28,110
Sit down!

765
00:34:28,110 --> 00:34:29,150
You'll rot in hell!

766
00:34:29,150 --> 00:34:29,760
Sit down!

767
00:34:30,850 --> 00:34:31,580
The court has

768
00:34:31,590 --> 00:34:33,590
examined and confirmed these facts.

769
00:34:33,590 --> 00:34:34,590
Defense counsel,

770
00:34:35,510 --> 00:34:37,840
do you have new submissions to make?

771
00:34:40,230 --> 00:34:41,580
Don't ask for trouble and end up

772
00:34:41,580 --> 00:34:42,840
irritating everyone.

773
00:34:44,110 --> 00:34:44,550
Yes.

774
00:34:45,230 --> 00:34:46,030
I'd like to ask

775
00:34:46,280 --> 00:34:47,670
the defendant questions.

776
00:34:47,670 --> 00:34:48,480
Great.

777
00:34:49,280 --> 00:34:49,800
Bravo.

778
00:34:50,590 --> 00:34:51,389
I'll allow it.

779
00:34:53,840 --> 00:34:54,480
Qiu Agui,

780
00:34:55,880 --> 00:34:57,280
this is your last chance.

781
00:34:58,590 --> 00:34:59,920
For the sake of yourself

782
00:35:00,510 --> 00:35:01,910
and your three children,

783
00:35:02,360 --> 00:35:04,220
please tell the court truthfully

784
00:35:05,190 --> 00:35:07,110
as to the real reason

785
00:35:08,000 --> 00:35:09,880
for your sudden intent to kill.

786
00:35:12,800 --> 00:35:13,920
The real reason?

787
00:35:15,030 --> 00:35:16,880
You're asking about the real reason?

788
00:35:16,880 --> 00:35:17,230
Yes,

789
00:35:17,760 --> 00:35:18,690
the real reason.

790
00:35:19,230 --> 00:35:19,630
I...

791
00:35:52,590 --> 00:35:53,320
Don't forget

792
00:35:54,190 --> 00:35:55,510
that only when you stay alive

793
00:35:55,510 --> 00:35:57,240
can you protect your children.

794
00:35:58,030 --> 00:35:58,510
Even if

795
00:35:58,510 --> 00:35:59,590
you have to serve time in prison,

796
00:35:59,590 --> 00:36:00,990
as long as you stay alive,

797
00:36:01,110 --> 00:36:02,190
they will still have hope and relief.

798
00:36:02,190 --> 00:36:03,880
The real reason
was that Huang Liancang beat me

799
00:36:03,880 --> 00:36:05,670
and I couldn't take it anymore.
That's all.

800
00:36:05,670 --> 00:36:06,730
Thank you, Mr. Li.

801
00:36:06,960 --> 00:36:08,560
Thank you, Presiding Judge.

802
00:36:25,000 --> 00:36:26,000
The defendant of this case

803
00:36:26,000 --> 00:36:28,320
failed to properly handle
family conflicts.

804
00:36:28,320 --> 00:36:30,590
She intentionally and unlawfully
deprived another person of life,

805
00:36:30,590 --> 00:36:32,400
displaying grave subjective malice.

806
00:36:32,400 --> 00:36:33,920
The prosecution deeply sympathizes

807
00:36:33,920 --> 00:36:36,670
with the defendant
for the long-term abuse she suffered,

808
00:36:36,670 --> 00:36:37,800
but does not believe

809
00:36:37,960 --> 00:36:39,400
that this constitutes a ground

810
00:36:39,400 --> 00:36:40,730
for a lenient sentence.

811
00:36:41,110 --> 00:36:41,770
Therefore,

812
00:36:42,000 --> 00:36:43,960
the prosecution firmly requests
the defendant

813
00:36:43,960 --> 00:36:46,690
be sentenced to death
in accordance with the law.

814
00:36:48,030 --> 00:36:49,030
Defense counsel,

815
00:36:51,110 --> 00:36:52,970
please state your final opinion.

816
00:36:54,840 --> 00:36:56,000
The defense rests.

817
00:36:57,150 --> 00:36:57,880
No, we don't.

818
00:36:59,840 --> 00:37:01,670
The defendant's crime of killing
is unforgivable,

819
00:37:01,670 --> 00:37:03,130
but she did it for a reason.

820
00:37:03,150 --> 00:37:03,730
The victim

821
00:37:03,730 --> 00:37:05,000
was greatly at fault first.

822
00:37:05,000 --> 00:37:05,630
It is our belief

823
00:37:05,630 --> 00:37:06,670
that this is a factor that may

824
00:37:06,670 --> 00:37:07,420
serve to mitigate

825
00:37:07,420 --> 00:37:09,480
the defendant's legal culpability.

826
00:37:11,880 --> 00:37:13,010
Defendant Qiu Agui,

827
00:37:14,000 --> 00:37:16,060
this is your one last chance to speak.

828
00:37:16,440 --> 00:37:18,640
Do you have anything to say to the court?

829
00:37:21,230 --> 00:37:22,320
I killed a man.

830
00:37:23,230 --> 00:37:24,830
I'm ready to pay with my life.

831
00:37:25,280 --> 00:37:27,070
I'm only begging my mother-in-law

832
00:37:27,070 --> 00:37:28,190
and my mother

833
00:37:28,780 --> 00:37:30,280
to take care of my three poor children

834
00:37:30,280 --> 00:37:31,940
since they're going to become

835
00:37:32,710 --> 00:37:34,110
completely parentless.

836
00:37:36,650 --> 00:37:38,180
Fortunately, my daughter,

837
00:37:38,400 --> 00:37:39,930
the eldest child, is 14 now.

838
00:37:40,750 --> 00:37:43,680
She can give proper care
to her two younger brothers.

839
00:37:44,920 --> 00:37:45,760
I beg you

840
00:37:46,590 --> 00:37:48,250
not to marry her off too early,

841
00:37:49,230 --> 00:37:51,560
so she can raise her two younger brothers.

842
00:37:54,230 --> 00:37:56,360
For that, you have my utter gratitude.

843
00:37:56,880 --> 00:37:57,550
Thank you.

844
00:37:59,070 --> 00:37:59,960
I beg you.

845
00:38:20,630 --> 00:38:21,920
The trial ends here.

846
00:38:23,000 --> 00:38:25,530
The verdict will be announced
at a later date.

847
00:38:25,590 --> 00:38:27,320
Take the defendant in custody.

848
00:38:51,590 --> 00:38:52,110
Ma'am!

849
00:38:52,590 --> 00:38:53,390
Wait a second!

850
00:38:55,800 --> 00:38:56,590
Can we have

851
00:38:57,960 --> 00:38:59,510
a little discussion

852
00:38:59,530 --> 00:39:00,390
on some things?

853
00:39:04,960 --> 00:39:06,030
We have no reason

854
00:39:06,030 --> 00:39:07,090
to shield Qiu Agui.

855
00:39:09,630 --> 00:39:10,320
On the contrary,

856
00:39:10,320 --> 00:39:11,400
we're doing this in your

857
00:39:11,400 --> 00:39:13,260
and your family's best interest.

858
00:39:14,230 --> 00:39:16,360
The dead can't be brought back to life.

859
00:39:16,670 --> 00:39:18,530
If Qiu Agui is sentenced to death,

860
00:39:19,550 --> 00:39:20,610
her three children

861
00:39:20,760 --> 00:39:21,480
will truly

862
00:39:21,480 --> 00:39:22,920
lose both parents.

863
00:39:24,070 --> 00:39:24,710
Besides,

864
00:39:25,070 --> 00:39:26,330
the kids are growing up

865
00:39:26,670 --> 00:39:28,330
and starting to get sensible.

866
00:39:29,110 --> 00:39:30,110
If they see you

867
00:39:30,800 --> 00:39:32,000
firmly demanding

868
00:39:32,030 --> 00:39:33,890
a death penalty for their mother,

869
00:39:34,030 --> 00:39:35,490
what will they think of you

870
00:39:35,840 --> 00:39:36,840
when they grow up?

871
00:39:41,230 --> 00:39:42,230
How about this?

872
00:39:43,360 --> 00:39:45,070
We'll go to Qiu Agui's parents' place

873
00:39:45,070 --> 00:39:47,670
to fight for as much compensation
as possible.

874
00:39:48,230 --> 00:39:50,280
Then you can issue a letter of forgiveness

875
00:39:50,280 --> 00:39:51,610
so she won't have to die.

876
00:39:52,360 --> 00:39:53,880
Even if she gets a death sentence
with a reprieve

877
00:39:53,880 --> 00:39:54,920
or life imprisonment,

878
00:39:54,920 --> 00:39:56,880
which will keep her
behind bars all her life,

879
00:39:56,880 --> 00:39:58,740
her children will still have hope

880
00:39:59,400 --> 00:40:01,110
as long as she stays alive.

881
00:40:03,710 --> 00:40:04,570
What do you say?

882
00:40:09,070 --> 00:40:10,110
Thank you

883
00:40:11,070 --> 00:40:13,270
for being so considerate of our family.

884
00:40:14,410 --> 00:40:15,360
We all want what's the best

885
00:40:15,360 --> 00:40:16,280
for these three kids,

886
00:40:16,280 --> 00:40:17,000
right?

887
00:40:17,320 --> 00:40:18,550
Such poor children.

888
00:40:22,230 --> 00:40:23,230
Presiding Judge,

889
00:40:25,960 --> 00:40:28,160
if you don't sentence Qiu Agui to death,

890
00:40:28,760 --> 00:40:30,440
I'll kill myself

891
00:40:31,030 --> 00:40:33,550
right at the gate of the court.

892
00:40:49,150 --> 00:40:50,110
Mrs. Hu, Mr. Liu,

893
00:40:51,320 --> 00:40:52,840
please share your opinions

894
00:40:52,840 --> 00:40:54,300
on how to rule on this case.

895
00:40:54,800 --> 00:40:55,440
Fang,

896
00:40:56,240 --> 00:40:58,500
you are a presiding judge for the people.

897
00:40:58,630 --> 00:41:00,150
You must not be biased

898
00:41:00,480 --> 00:41:02,030
or speak for a murderer.

899
00:41:03,070 --> 00:41:03,870
Imagine this.

900
00:41:04,030 --> 00:41:05,370
If your son were hacked

901
00:41:05,480 --> 00:41:06,610
to death by his wife,

902
00:41:06,960 --> 00:41:08,030
could you forgive her

903
00:41:08,030 --> 00:41:09,030
and let her live?

904
00:41:09,760 --> 00:41:11,290
Could you not take revenge?

905
00:41:13,070 --> 00:41:14,190
To be honest,

906
00:41:14,670 --> 00:41:16,590
my son also beats his wife.

907
00:41:17,400 --> 00:41:18,230
In Nanyu,

908
00:41:18,480 --> 00:41:20,580
lots of men beat their wives.

909
00:41:21,000 --> 00:41:22,860
I've been through the same thing.

910
00:41:23,290 --> 00:41:24,550
Of course, abusing others

911
00:41:24,550 --> 00:41:25,680
is certainly wrong.

912
00:41:25,840 --> 00:41:27,280
But we can educate these men.

913
00:41:27,280 --> 00:41:28,800
Wives can't kill their husbands

914
00:41:28,800 --> 00:41:29,710
just over

915
00:41:29,880 --> 00:41:31,210
some family conflicts.

916
00:41:31,590 --> 00:41:32,590
If that becomes a norm,

917
00:41:32,590 --> 00:41:34,190
won't there be many tragedies
in the future?

918
00:41:34,190 --> 00:41:34,880
Mrs. Hu,

919
00:41:35,320 --> 00:41:36,320
you're also a woman.

920
00:41:36,320 --> 00:41:38,320
How can you say something like that?

921
00:41:38,320 --> 00:41:38,590
No, I mean...

922
00:41:38,590 --> 00:41:39,220
Mr. Liu.

923
00:41:39,710 --> 00:41:41,170
Share your views, please.

924
00:41:44,590 --> 00:41:45,150
Fang,

925
00:41:46,590 --> 00:41:47,650
please forgive me.

926
00:41:48,630 --> 00:41:50,030
What happened to Qiu Agui

927
00:41:52,070 --> 00:41:53,470
reminded me of my mother.

928
00:41:54,560 --> 00:41:55,630
Through all her life, she was

929
00:41:55,630 --> 00:41:57,030
also beaten by my father.

930
00:41:58,030 --> 00:41:59,690
Later, in her fifties, she...

931
00:42:00,550 --> 00:42:01,680
she hanged herself.

932
00:42:02,840 --> 00:42:04,570
Let me state my position first.

933
00:42:04,960 --> 00:42:05,710
I agree...

934
00:42:07,110 --> 00:42:08,510
to spare Qiu Agui's life.

935
00:42:17,840 --> 00:42:19,670
So she really didn't get a death penalty?

936
00:42:19,670 --> 00:42:20,530
She almost did.

937
00:42:21,720 --> 00:42:22,960
The assessor I brought in,

938
00:42:22,960 --> 00:42:23,550
Mrs. Hu,

939
00:42:24,360 --> 00:42:25,490
was a total mistake.

940
00:42:26,160 --> 00:42:27,840
Luckily, Lihui brought in Mr. Liu,
who finally said

941
00:42:27,840 --> 00:42:29,170
something reasonable.

942
00:42:29,190 --> 00:42:29,790
Two to one.

943
00:42:30,400 --> 00:42:32,000
A death sentence with a reprieve.

944
00:42:32,000 --> 00:42:33,650
The credit actually goes to Jianmin.

945
00:42:33,650 --> 00:42:34,730
It was he who told me

946
00:42:34,760 --> 00:42:35,860
that Mr. Liu was the kindest

947
00:42:35,860 --> 00:42:37,060
among all assessors.

948
00:42:37,880 --> 00:42:39,010
Thank you, Jianmin.

949
00:42:39,760 --> 00:42:40,550
Not so soon.

950
00:42:41,480 --> 00:42:42,940
Things are not looking up.

951
00:42:43,760 --> 00:42:44,360
This case will

952
00:42:44,360 --> 00:42:46,690
ultimately go to the judicial committee.

953
00:42:46,760 --> 00:42:49,020
Just think about the current situation.

954
00:42:50,510 --> 00:42:52,440
Are you implying that Qiu Agui will

955
00:42:53,670 --> 00:42:54,730
still be executed?

956
00:42:55,590 --> 00:42:56,550
I didn't say that.
